  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Mean&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p>Variance&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>q</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>i.e.&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Now&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>54</mn><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>X</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>54</mn><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>X</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>X</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>X</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>54</mn><mfenced><mrow><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>6</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>6</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>1</mn></msup><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>5</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>0</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>6</mn></mmultiscripts><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>0</mn></msup><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>6</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://